/* ===== 0.42.0: hints in three steps, what a sentence already does well, and paragraphs in another order. All three are fixed rules. ===== */
/* Hints. A note shows its question and what the rule saw. The advice comes one step at a time, when asked for: where to look, what kind of change, and one way to do it. No step writes the new sentence; the last gives the note's own suggestion. The second step waits for an edit, or for HINTWAIT. A hint is offered, never pushed, after two edits that leave the note open. Both numbers are working values. */
