/* The Guide draws each picture at half size, by zooming a box that is twice as wide as its tile. Browsers differ on whether a percentage width inside a zoomed box is taken before or after the zoom, and where it is taken after, the picture comes out at full size and is cut off on the right. So the width is measured, and set to fit. */
